# The SIMD and MMX unit tests, indented with spaces end to end unlike the engine
# sources, so they keep spaces: formatting one line here into tabs would leave
# the file arguing with itself.
#
# This covers original/ as well, whose files are verbatim copies of the
# implementations the ported routines are checked against. Being byte-identical
# is their purpose; the hook only formats lines a change writes, so a copy that
# is not edited is never touched either way.
#
# Everything else is inherited from the .clang-format at the repository root.
BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig
UseTab: Never
IndentWidth: 2
TabWidth: 2
